    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Kira Eldridge",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107013086750965540680/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKGutL8iuQgJUYrkdFZAAbmPmusNQwQ2B9TqJ59JZKDQDd0rQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I am absolutely amazed by the quality and customer service haus of extensions offer! She is amazing, takes every second to make sure the quality, colour, texture, etc is done properly! She puts all her clients first, she will even work around your work or school schedules and works extremely hard:)\nIf anyone is thinking of getting hair extensions and is worried or not 100% sure, this is your sign to get them!! I am IN LOVE with my extensions!\nIf your thinking of extensions, give her a call! See her for a consult and go from there, I promise you- you will NOT be disappointed!!",
        "time": 1718252945,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Laleh Hafezi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106372539787086057543/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWssORN6sd1XNRmpuzIvcHK-coG2qbiNdE45i0xgxa6lP8NpJPl=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I had an absolutely phenomenal experience at this hair extension place! Parisa was not only incredibly patient and friendly but also exceptionally meticulous in her work. She went above and beyond to ensure every detail was perfect, and the results are just stunning. I am thrilled with my new hair and would wholeheartedly recommend her to anyone looking for top-notch service and results!",
        "time": 1753321675,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "kamalpreet kaur",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100756212159553613620/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUE0-lja2WUP4bNEN4xWBTUCV3v_qVre_ANWNNY8Xl7emGHoNqN=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "I had the most amazing experience getting extensions done! From the moment I arrived, I felt completely at ease. Parisa is incredibly friendly, professional, and truly caring throughout the whole process. She took her time to explain everything, made sure I was comfortable, and was so gentle with my hair.\n\nThe results are absolutely beautiful – natural-looking, lightweight, and exactly what I hoped for. You can tell she really takes pride in her work and cares about her clients.\n\nHighly recommend \"Haus of Hair Extensions\" to anyone looking for a great experience with hair extensions and a stylist who genuinely cares!",
        "time": 1749048618,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "E",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104099609927792958090/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKq5Hcsvc9-7FqlFr8AyQfzJHBFGKORD0FCmFJJHrhQLNk8Rg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "So happy with my experience at Haus of Hair Extensions! Parisa was so accommodating and flexible. She did an amazing job matching my color and the transformation was incredible. You can tell she really cares about her clients and puts so much pride into her work. Her space is great and she’s super kind and easy to talk to.",
        "time": 1745074471,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "April Arbuckle",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111920328952986940726/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIUDL7EORxtq3GRHz9k79VvTgKyEibxQ55WZgesmsLWm_aXCQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
